        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika marapena okudho gwara pere, to pe kodi mac m'oruwere gi remo wok to oy ri piny. Acel wiy adek ma piny owaŋ, to acel wiy adek ma yen waŋ woko, to lum m'onwaŋo nyaboke pendi je waŋ woko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.8.7"
            ]
