              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo fodi aŋiyo, awinjo ango m'oyido ringo malo swa i koyo munyo koko gi dwonde ma malo ni, “Awi kidamba! Kidamba! Kidamba kidho bedo ri ji ma piny ro derino ma gwarin ma jomalaika m'odoŋ adek jocegin kudho!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.13",
